        "blockId": "syntax-concept",
        "dimensions": [
          "syntax",
          "concept"
        ],
        "text": "working修饰definition，并非说定义正在劳动；of a critical defect说明定义对象，agree on说明需要共同确定表述。 团队先约定怎样识别当前讨论的对象，以便继续分类和收集资料。working允许之后修订，但并不意味着可以随意改变已批准标准。",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "oewn-2025",
            "sourceVersion": "2025",
            "locator": "entries-w.json/working/a / working%5:00:00:impermanent:00",
            "supportedClaim": "adopted as a temporary basis for further work",
            "url": "https://en-word.net/"
          },
          {
            "sourceId": "oewn-2025",
            "sourceVersion": "2025",
            "locator": "entries-d.json/definition/n / definition%1:10:00::",
            "supportedClaim": "a concise explanation of the meaning of a word or phrase or symbol",
            "url": "https://en-word.net/"
          }
        ],
        "title": "句子结构与当前所指"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "contrast",
        "dimensions": [
          "contrast"
        ],
        "text": "working definition是推进讨论的暂用定义；正式标准定义可能来自适用规范。两者冲突时要明确适用范围，不能让暂定说法替代强制要求。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "容易混淆的地方"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "game-neighbors",
        "dimensions": [
          "languageGame",
          "englishNeighbors"
        ],
        "text": "这是概念对齐。相关人员可以给出边界案例，检查同一缺陷是否被一致分类；原句没有给出critical defect的具体安全判准。 agree on a definition连到examples/borderline cases；后续常问Does this case fit the definition?，用实例检查理解是否一致。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "讨论通常怎样继续"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "action",
        "dimensions": [
          "pragmaticAction"
        ],
        "text": "说话者在邀请建立共同讨论基础，不是在宣布一个完整质量标准已经批准。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "说话者正在做什么"
      },
      {
        "blockId": "workplace",
        "dimensions": [
          "workplaceUse"
        ],
        "text": "下面是迁移到制造业沟通的新例句；不代表原场景中已发生的决定。",
        "sourceRefs": [],
        "title": "迁移到工作情境"
      }
